		(property "Description" "Stand Off Reflow Compatible\n\nA metal standoff that can be placed and reflowed onto a PCB.\n\nThe M2.5 x 2.5mm variant is used on MicroMod.\n\nThe M2.5 x 1.5mm variant is used to hold mPCIe boards, including the Swarm M138.\n\nThe M2.0 x 6.0mm variant is used to mount the Iridium 9603N modem."
